{"clase": "<h4>Branch and Bound (ramificación y acotamiento)</h4>\n<ol><li>Resuelve la RL (nodo P0). Si es entera, terminaste.</li>\n<li>Elige una variable fraccionaria x<sub>j</sub> = 3,4 y crea dos subproblemas: <b>x<sub>j</sub> ≤ 3</b> y <b>x<sub>j</sub> ≥ 4</b>. La franja 3 &lt; x<sub>j</sub> &lt; 4 no tiene enteros, así que no se pierde nada.</li>\n<li>Resuelve cada subproblema gráficamente (misma región + la nueva restricción).</li>\n<li>Un nodo se <b>poda</b> (no se ramifica más) si:<ul><li>es <b>infactible</b>,</li><li>su solución es <b>entera</b> → candidata (incumbente si es la mejor),</li><li>su Z ≤ Z de la incumbente (<b>poda por cota</b>).</li></ul></li>\n<li>Al no quedar nodos abiertos, la incumbente es el óptimo.</li></ol>\n<p>En cada nodo escribe x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> y Z, y sobre cada rama la restricción agregada.</p>", "ejemplos": [{"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 2x<sub>1</sub> + 3x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 7<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;−2x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 5<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;10x<sub>1</sub> + 9x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 45<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> Resuelva el problema entero mediante Branch and Bound (muestre el árbol).</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en cada vértice:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 300\" class=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Región factible\"><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"34.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"82.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"82.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"82.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"130.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"130.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"130.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"178.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"178.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"178.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"226.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"226.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"226.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"274.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"274.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"274.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><line x1=\"322.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"322.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"322.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"218.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"218.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"222.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"170.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"170.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"174.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"122.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"122.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"126.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"74.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"74.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"78.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266\" class=\"axl\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"12\" class=\"axl\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"260\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">x₁</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"20\" class=\"ax\">x₂</text><polygon points=\"34.0,266.0 250.0,266.0 151.8,156.9 66.0,114.0 34.0,146.0\" class=\"reg\"/><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"98.0\" x2=\"328.0\" y2=\"245.0\" class=\"cl c0\"/><text x=\"73.3\" y=\"111.6\" class=\"clab c0\">(1)</text><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"146.0\" x2=\"128.0\" y2=\"52.0\" class=\"cl c1\"/><text x=\"66.2\" y=\"113.8\" class=\"clab c1\">(2)</text><line x1=\"57.4\" y1=\"52.0\" x2=\"250.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"cl c2\"/><text x=\"153.8\" y=\"150.7\" class=\"clab c2\">(3)</text><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"218.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"170.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"82.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"82.0\" cy=\"218.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"82.0\" cy=\"170.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"82.0\" cy=\"122.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"130.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"130.0\" cy=\"218.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"130.0\" cy=\"170.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"178.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"178.0\" cy=\"218.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"226.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"66.0\" cy=\"114.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"146.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"151.8\" cy=\"156.9\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"250.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"151.8\" cy=\"156.9\" r=\"6\" class=\"opt\"/><text x=\"159.8\" y=\"148.9\" class=\"olab\">RL (27/11; 25/11)</text><rect x=\"77.0\" y=\"117.0\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"iopt\"/><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"136.0\" class=\"ilab\">entera (1; 3)</text></svg><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Vértice (x₁; x₂)</th><th>Z</th><th>Z (decimal)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>(0; 0)</th><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>(0; 5/2)</th><td>15/2</td><td>7,5</td></tr><tr><th>(2/3; 19/6)</th><td>65/6</td><td>10,833</td></tr><tr><th>(27/11; 25/11)</th><td>129/11</td><td>11,727</td></tr><tr><th>(9/2; 0)</th><td>9</td><td>9</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Óptimo de la RL: x<sub>1</sub> = 27/11 ≈ 2,455, x<sub>2</sub> = 25/11 ≈ 2,273, Z = 129/11 ≈ <b>11,727</b>. Es una <b>cota superior</b> para el problema entero.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Branch and Bound</h5><p>Se ramifica la primera variable fraccionaria (x<sub>1</sub> antes que x<sub>2</sub>), explorando primero la rama ≤. Cada nodo se resuelve gráficamente agregando su restricción.</p><div class=\"tree\"><ul><li><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P0</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 2,455<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2,273<br>Z = 11,727<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 2</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P1</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 2<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2,5<br>Z = 11,5<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 2</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P11</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 2<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2<br>Z = 10<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 3</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P12</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 1<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 3<br>Z = 11<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div><div class=\"nn\">mejora la incumbente anterior (P11, Z = 10)</div></div></li></ul></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 3</div><div class=\"node pod\"><div class=\"nl\">P2</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 1,667<br>Z = 11<div class=\"tg\">Poda por cota</div><div class=\"nn\">Z = 11 ≤ incumbente 11</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></div><p><b>Óptimo entero:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 1, x<sub>2</sub> = 3, Z = <b>11</b> (nodo P12). Gap = 11,727 − 11 = 0,727.</p></div>", "intro": "Problema 2 del C2 2026-1 (Prof. Obreque)."}], "ejercicios": [{"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 6x<sub>1</sub> + 3x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;−3x<sub>1</sub> + 6x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 1<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3x<sub>1</sub> + 9x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 16<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;8x<sub>1</sub> + 7x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 41<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> Resuelva el problema entero mediante Branch and Bound (muestre el árbol).</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart