2,266.0 248.5,261.8 116.3,217.8\" class=\"reg\"/><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"258.9\" x2=\"275.2\" y2=\"138.3\" class=\"cl c0\"/><text x=\"66.9\" y=\"240.4\" class=\"clab c0\">(1)</text><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"190.3\" x2=\"261.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"cl c1\"/><text x=\"106.1\" y=\"209.0\" class=\"clab c1\">(2)</text><line x1=\"140.4\" y1=\"138.3\" x2=\"252.2\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"cl c2\"/><text x=\"198.1\" y=\"195.6\" class=\"clab c2\">(3)</text><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"76.6\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"119.1\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"119.1\" cy=\"223.4\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"161.7\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"204.3\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"246.9\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"258.9\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"116.3\" cy=\"217.8\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"252.2\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"248.5\" cy=\"261.8\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"252.2\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"6\" class=\"opt\"/><text x=\"260.2\" y=\"258.0\" class=\"olab\">RL (41/8; 0)</text><rect x=\"241.9\" y=\"261.0\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"iopt\"/><text x=\"254.9\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ilab\">entera (5; 0)</text></svg><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Vértice (x₁; x₂)</th><th>Z</th><th>Z (decimal)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>(0; 0)</th><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>(0; 1/6)</th><td>1/2</td><td>0,5</td></tr><tr><th>(29/15; 17/15)</th><td>15</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><th>(257/51; 5/51)</th><td>519/17</td><td>30,529</td></tr><tr><th>(41/8; 0)</th><td>123/4</td><td>30,75</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Óptimo de la RL: x<sub>1</sub> = 41/8 ≈ 5,125, x<sub>2</sub> = 0 ≈ 0, Z = 123/4 ≈ <b>30,75</b>. Es una <b>cota superior</b> para el problema entero.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Branch and Bound</h5><p>Se ramifica la primera variable fraccionaria (x<sub>1</sub> antes que x<sub>2</sub>), explorando primero la rama ≤. Cada nodo se resuelve gráficamente agregando su restricción.</p><div class=\"tree\"><ul><li><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P0</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 5,125<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 0<br>Z = 30,75<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 5</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P1</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 5<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 0,111<br>Z = 30,333<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 0</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P11</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 5<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 0<br>Z = 30<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 1</div><div class=\"node pod\"><div class=\"nl\">P12</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 2,333<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 1<br>Z = 17<div class=\"tg\">Poda por cota</div><div class=\"nn\">Z = 17 ≤ incumbente 30</div></div></li></ul></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 6</div><div class=\"node nf\"><div class=\"nl\">P2</div><b>Infactible</b><div class=\"tg\">Poda: infactible</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></div><p><b>Óptimo entero:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 5, x<sub>2</sub> = 0, Z = <b>30</b> (nodo P11). Gap = 30,75 − 30 = 0,75.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 3x<sub>1</sub> + 8x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;9x<sub>1</sub> + 3x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 44<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;7x<sub>1</sub> + 4x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 18<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> Resuelva el problema entero mediante Branch and Bound (muestre el árbol).</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en ca